download, reproduce, run, study, modify, and share the Materials non-commercially.
Permitted purposes are limited to personal research, self-education, experiments,
backtesting, non-commercial hobby projects, and trading solely with that person's
own funds for that person's own account. Profit from this personal-account
trading is expressly permitted as an exception to the non-commercial restriction.
An individual may rent general-purpose cloud compute or storage for these uses.
This does not grant the provider an independent right to exploit the Materials
or permit the individual to offer prohibited services through that infrastructure.

3. Prohibited uses
No organizational-use rights are granted. Use by companies, corporations, legal
entities, partnerships, funds, financial institutions, quantitative trading firms,
proprietary trading firms, or other organizations is prohibited. Use by anyone
on their behalf, as part of employment duties, or for their business, research,
trading, or other organizational benefit is also prohibited, including internal
use and unpaid trials.
All commercial use is prohibited, including commercial products; paid,
advertising-supported, or otherwise monetized services; SaaS; APIs; paid signals;
consulting; analytics; software or model sales; commercial sublicensing; trading
for others; managing third-party capital; and asset-management services. An
individual's commercial business is equally prohibited. The own-funds trading
exception in section 2 does not cover organizational accounts, client capital,
pooled funds, managed accounts, or revenue-sharing services.

4. Sharing and modifications
Permitted individuals may distribute original or modified Materials without
charge if they retain this entire license, copyright notices, and third-party
notices; clearly identify modifications; and preserve the same use restrictions
for recipients. They may not relicense the Materials to grant commercial or
organizational rights or imply endorsement by the original authors. Recipients
receive rights directly under this license, not an expandable sublicense. These
conditions do not alter the original licenses of separable third-party components.

5. Rights boundaries
All ungranted rights are reserved. No trademark rights, market-data redistribution
rights, or third-party patent rights are granted. This license does not restrict
acts independently permitted by mandatory law. Users must separately obtain
appropriate rights to third-party components and data. Models and outputs are
covered only to the extent of rights legally held by the project's copyright
holders and expressly released under this license. No ownership of users'
pre-existing data or third-party content is claimed.

6. Breach and termination
Rights granted here terminate immediately upon breach of any term. The user must
stop use and distribution relying on this license. Termination does not revoke
rights independently granted by third parties. Reinstatement requires express
written authorization from the copyright holder. This license itself grants no
commercial or organizational permission.

7. Disclaimer and limitation of liability
TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY APPLICABLE LAW, THE MATERIALS ARE PROVIDED
"AS IS", WITHOUT EXPRESS OR IMPLIED WARRANTIES, INCLUDING MERCHANTABILITY,
